---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
---
<Base title="Request a tailored product demonstration" description="Explore Smart Exam around your examination workflow, department governance and customer-hosted deployment requirements.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-title-only"><span class="eyebrow">Request a demo</span><h1>See how your examinations could work.</h1><p class="intro">A focused discussion for your assessment and technology teams. Start with your workflow, then explore the platform and deployment scope.</p></div></section>
<section class="form-section"><div class="container form-layout"><aside class="form-aside"><span class="eyebrow">Built around your requirements</span><h2>A useful conversation starts with context.</h2><p>Tell us who your examinations serve, what your teams need to control and how you plan to operate the platform.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><strong>Understand the process</strong><p>Programs, candidates, departments and the problem you want to solve.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>Explore a relevant scenario</strong><p>Question banks, delivery, human proctoring and evidence review using synthetic data.</p></div><div class="step"><strong>Define the next step</strong><p>Technical discovery and a scoped acceptance pilot where there is a fit.</p></div></div><div class="contact-options"><a href="/demo/">Explore the illustrative walkthrough</a><a href="/downloads/smart-exam-brochure.pdf">Download the product brochure (PDF)</a></div></aside><LeadForm kind="demo" buttonLabel="Request a demonstration" /></div></section>
</Base>
